            {
                "entry_id": "979ad51c-dcec-30c2-bf84-a660a832b5e3",
                "word": "grunge",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0d39ff58-c6ea-411f-a21f-dfe45ef5b525",
                        "entry_id": "979ad51c-dcec-30c2-bf84-a660a832b5e3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "grunges"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9dc5254-26d2-36db-9981-594965b6935c",
                        "entry_id": "979ad51c-dcec-30c2-bf84-a660a832b5e3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Genre musical dérivé du rock alternatif apparu vers le milieu des années 1980 à Seattle, inspiré par le punk hardcore, le heavy metal et le rock indé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8e966ad-1a9a-4830-b0c2-a29e4b849b7e",
                                "sense_id": "a9dc5254-26d2-36db-9981-594965b6935c",
                                "text": "Le grunge est caractérisé par un son de guitare lourd et saturé, des mesures variables, et des paroles apathiques ou emplies d’angoisses."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c1e4f23c-421a-3ff2-957d-c58c7b5919e6",
                        "entry_id": "979ad51c-dcec-30c2-bf84-a660a832b5e3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Aspect volontairement sale et négligé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0419f178-83ff-411d-b830-c682ec0d4f2d",
                                "sense_id": "c1e4f23c-421a-3ff2-957d-c58c7b5919e6",
                                "text": "La collusion de l’art et du commerce est à ce point ironique, que même le monde de la mode récupère le look dépenaillé du grunge, un comble pour un mouvement dont le terme originel désigne la crasse entre les orteils !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3dbecdcf-036f-4ef2-a0c6-8384bb0e891e",
                                "sense_id": "c1e4f23c-421a-3ff2-957d-c58c7b5919e6",
                                "text": "Avec sa bande, Thomas tient un coin du parking, un peu à part, ce qui ne lui déplaît pas. Attention, sous ses aspects grunge, c’est une personnalisation qui a ses règles, et qui n’utilise que des pièces d’origine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "362fbcec-ed8e-4592-9b1a-3693a184fbe3",
                                "sense_id": "c1e4f23c-421a-3ff2-957d-c58c7b5919e6",
                                "text": "Elle-même à l’époque n’était certainement pas grunge, je le voyais plutôt comme une Versaillaise, enfin une Versaillaise modérée, un peu tradi sans être intégriste."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fad103a9-7dfc-41dc-bacd-262fa03ddb1b",
                        "source_entry_id": "979ad51c-dcec-30c2-bf84-a660a832b5e3",
                        "target_lang_word": "grunge",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "grunge",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97e53069-b047-30db-a08e-8f29172e057a",
                                        "entry_id": "655db1f0-4aff-30e8-b6e0-13754de5297b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dirt or filth, especially when difficult to clean."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "912a057a-a18a-4cbe-ba43-ba6814375323",
                                                "sense_id": "97e53069-b047-30db-a08e-8f29172e057a",
                                                "text": "The cinema floor was covered in grunge deposited by the crowds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4389671b-d4b7-37a7-a124-bdcc2dfb0dae",
                                        "entry_id": "655db1f0-4aff-30e8-b6e0-13754de5297b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being filthy; grubbiness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2449163-9135-421d-80cc-bfecf914d47b",
                                                "sense_id": "4389671b-d4b7-37a7-a124-bdcc2dfb0dae",
                                                "text": "Chad used to work as a coal miner, but couldn't handle the constant grunge."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13607292-06ea-38d6-9e6c-93ddf239790f",
                                        "entry_id": "655db1f0-4aff-30e8-b6e0-13754de5297b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A subgenre of alternative rock, originating from Seattle, Washington in the early 1990s, which melds punk and metal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72e0f813-b3bb-4127-9fcf-9ebc7a3cbf72",
                                                "sense_id": "13607292-06ea-38d6-9e6c-93ddf239790f",
                                                "text": "Alice liked to wear plaids and ripped jeans, and listen to grunge."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f1b5107-b356-40d3-b166-79309ae7de7e",
                                                "sense_id": "13607292-06ea-38d6-9e6c-93ddf239790f",
                                                "text": "Grunge was the de facto soundtrack of the early nineties. It’s also sometimes criticized for its sonic limitations—most groups played the same way, at the same speed and with the same worldview, usually mining the same handful of influences. It was, by design, a derivative musical form. But it did introduce at least one new idea to mainstream rock: a collective sense of self-aware skepticism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bd68ef13-d42e-4023-b78b-991944b30f7d",
                        "source_entry_id": "979ad51c-dcec-30c2-bf84-a660a832b5e3",
